{"id":"ehe","lemma":"ehe","pos":"conj","rank":671,"glosses":["before, ere","rather than"],"ipa":"/ˈʔeːə/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/f1/De-ehe.ogg/De-ehe.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Wie wichtig ist dir die Ehe?","en":"How important is marriage to you?","words":[{"g":"how"},{"g":"important"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"du"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Denke nach, ehe du sprichst!","en":"Think before you speak.","words":[{"g":"to think","l":"denken"},{"g":"after / to"},null,{"g":"you"},{"g":"to speak","l":"sprechen"}]},{"text":"Komm, wir gehen, ehe es schlimmer wird.","en":"Let's go before things get worse.","words":[{"g":"to come","l":"kommen"},{"g":"we"},{"g":"to go, to walk"},null,{"g":"it"},{"g":"worse"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"}]},{"text":"Ehe ist die Verbindung von Mann und Frau.","en":"Marriage is the union of a man and woman.","words":[null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"connection"},{"g":"from / of"},{"g":"man, male human being"},{"g":"and"},{"g":"woman"}]},{"text":"Die Ehe macht einigen Leuten Angst.","en":"Marriage frightens some people.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to make","l":"machen"},{"g":"to unite or unify"},{"g":"people","l":"Leute"},{"g":"fear"}]}]}